{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>The nesher.</b> Aigle (eagle). And because it gazes from afar it is called נשר, from the root אשורנו. <b>The peres.</b> Ossifrage. And because it spreads its wings it is so called, from the root אפרוש כפי and ויפרוש כפיו. <b>The dakhniyah.</b> Orfraie (osprey). And because of its boldness and stubbornness it is so called."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:11:15.066684575Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}